_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All H(H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 C4-H4b
 1 with sigma of 0.02
 O2-H2
 0.95 with sigma of 0.01
 C3-H3 \\sim C4-H4b \\sim C4-H4a \\sim C2-H2a \\sim C2-H2b
 with sigma of 0.005
 C1-H1 \\sim C3-H3
 with sigma of 0.005
3. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uiso(H4a) = Uiso(H4b) = Uiso(H2a) = Uiso(H2b)
Uiso(H3) = Uiso(H2a) = Uiso(H2b) = Uiso(H4b) = Uiso(H4a)
Uiso(H19a) = Uiso(H19b) = Uiso(H19c)
Uiso(H20b) = Uiso(H20c) = Uiso(H20a)
4.a Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C11(H11), C12(H12), C15(H15), C9(H9), C14(H14), C17(H17), C18(H18)
4.b Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 C20(H20a,H20b,H20c), C19(H19a,H19b,H19c)
;
